//
//  Gathering stage 2, part "Harvesting": what the retail server sends around a harvest of a resource node (tests/capture_gather.h, generated by tools/capture/gen_gather.py from
//  ten captures) against the typed codecs of protocol/repl.
//
//    * ClientUpdateItemDurability (storage_rpc.h): the ten harvests' payloads read to their last bit, typed (the Equipment container, one tool, its slot, its new durability) and
//      written back to the exact bits; the codec refuses what is no update
//    * the node channel of capture 1427: the open's component block reads to its last bit with the harvest's state (the status 0x08000001 and the counter 1, the harvester's pawn,
//      who channels), the 96 heartbeats read and the counter goes up by 3 in its top five bits with every one (wrapping at 32), the first takes InteractingPlayer off, the done
//      update reads (bGathered, the status 0x20000004, no one channeling, CanInputActivate [false], the interaction state 0)
//    * capture 1454's open of a gathered node: the status 0xB0000004 (counter 22), no InteractingPlayer, CanInputActivate [false], the state 0 and CachedState 1
//    * the facts of the ten harvests: every one has a durability update in its result frame; the full bag (1461) has no storage event, the bonus drops (1470) three; a result
//      frame's storage events and experience map items are what the generator read
//    * the pawn's InteractInfo.ChannelingData (FChannelingData, channeling_codec.h; Gathering stage 2 test 1: the retail server sets it with the node's wake and clears it with the
//      result, and without it the client plays no gather animation, shows no bar and never sends its own cancel): the ten harvests' set and clear blocks read to their last bit, typed,
//      and are written back to the exact bits; what the codec refuses
// ============================================================================
